    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Translator Text now supports the Maori language. Learn more about the Maori language release by reading our <a href=\"https://blogs.microsoft.com/on-the-issues/2019/11/21/preserving-maori-language-microsoft-translator/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blog</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>See <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/Translator/language-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">more information</a> on other languages that Translator supports.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Translator Text now supports the Maori language. Learn more about the Maori language release by reading our blog .\n\nSee more information on other languages that Translator supports."
  },
